<title>POLAND: Bank Slaski surges 9.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Slaski surges 9.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Slaski, one of the Warsaw bourse's heavyweights, soared 9.9 pct in the session's heaviest 13.8-million-zloty trade and analysts said the move was likely to have been caused by a single large buy-order.</p>
<p>&quot;It's probably a purchase by a foreign institutional investor or a Polish fund, but the scale of the jump is somewhat surprising,&quot; one analyst said.</p>
<p>Traders said there were no fundamental or technical signals in sight which otherwise could justify sich a strong jump.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
